DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260702
DTSTAMP:20260827T212256Z
UID:c0b701a3cdeac56baf3aa8f83be10d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Located on the Inn’s second floor\, The Fitz Gallery present
 s a special exhibition highlighting the remarkable history of The Red Lion
  Inn through 253 years of treasured archives\, historic photographs\, arti
 facts\, memorabilia\, and stories. The complimentary exhibit illustrates h
 ow one of America’s oldest continuously operating inns has welcomed gene
 rations of travelers while witnessing the nation’s evolution from coloni
 al times to today. Admission is free.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent pa
 ge: https://berkshires.org/events-old/the-fitz-gallery-exhibit-the-red-lio
 n-inn-three-years-older-than-america/
