DESCRIPTION:Join us as Robert Oakes\, author of Ghosts of the Berkshires 
 \, leads you through the rooms and halls of this historic estate sharing t
 ales of its hauntings. Stand in the places where the eerie encounters occu
 rred\, listen to the first-hand accounts of those who experienced them\, a
 nd maybe even experience something unusual yourself. This is not an active
