 on over the last 250 years. Featuring acclaimed Berkshire performers Ron R
 amsay and Samatha Talora\, each thematic salon blends storytelling\, histo
 ry and a wide range of musical genres including patriotic songs\, jazz sta
 ndards\, pop classics\, and Broadway favorites. Reservations recommended. 
