BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summit Sounds Concert Series at Bousquet
DTSTART:20260813T170000
DTEND:20260813T200000
DTSTAMP:20260827T212256Z
UID:1ae74620667cb1f895f1bc9b45864f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Some concerts you watch. Some you feel. Summit Sounds is the l
 atter – an intimate live music experience at the top of Bousquet Mountai
 n\, surrounded by sweeping views of Berkshire County as the late summer su
 n goes down. Your ticket includes a scenic chairlift ride up the mountain
 \, so the experience starts before the first note even plays. 08/13: Movin
 ’ On: Movin’ On is back on the summit for another night of great music
 \, and they’re bringing everything that made their last visit worth talk
 ing about. 08/20: Grateful BRO: If you’ve seen Grateful BRO at Summit So
 unds before\, you already know. If you haven’t – here’s your chance 
 to fix that. This returning favorite brings the good-time energy that’s 
 become a hallmark of the Summit Sounds series: intimate\, unhurried\, and 
 set against some of the best views in Berkshire County. 08/27: The Housie 
 Shakers: There’s something special about seeing a band where half the cr
 owd already knows the players. Housie Shakers brings that hometown energy 
 to the Bousquet Mountain summit\, familiar faces\, great vibes\, and the k
 ind of music that makes a late summer evening feel exactly right.\n\nSourc
 es: The Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/summit-s
 ounds-concert-series-at-bousquet/
LOCATION:Bousquet Mountain\, 101 Dan Fox Road\, Pittsfield\, MA\, 01201
URL:https://berkshires.org/events-old/summit-sounds-concert-series-at-bous
 quet/
END:VEVENT
