DTSTART:20260828T170000
DTEND:20260828T193000
DTSTAMP:20260827T212256Z
UID:d6272c490c54ae748627d28789150b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Come see the newly renovated museum at night and participate i
 n revolutionary-themed activities to engage with history in a new and fun 
 way! Beginning in the events hall visitors will start their journey\, as t
 hey did at Easton’s Tavern\, before gathering clues and information thro
 ughout the museum on their way to the ‘fort’ where light refreshments 
 will be served. Bring along your own ‘battalion’ as you participate in
  a unique experience incorporating revolutionary history with the Voices o
 f Rebellion: Berkshires’ Revolutionary Legacy exhibition at this Night a
 t the Museum event.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berksh
 ires.org/events-old/revolutionary-night-at-the-museum/
