 st Maeve Gilchrist for an exhilarating evening of fiddle music and dance! 
 Enjoy the traditional session hosted by Abbie MacQuarrie along with some s
 urprise special guests. And be prepared to grab a partner and dance as Abb
 ie teaches some easy-to-learn traditional Ceili-dances. Pure-drop fun! Loc
 ation: Third Floor Reception Hall\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page:
