BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Strings on Strings
DTSTART:20260912T190000
DTEND:20260912T203000
DTSTAMP:20260827T212256Z
UID:963f0f1e33082d0dd17e078a6f6033@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Maeve Gilchrist | Copley Street | The Fretless (with special g
 uest Madeleine Rogers) | Edwin Huizinga and William Coulter (Fire and Grac
 e) A string focused extravaganza of a night where we hear music from the w
 orld-class\, pure-drop traditional sounds of Boston-based band\, Copley St
 reet (Joey Abarta\, Nathan Gourley and Owen Marshall) next to Baroque fidd
 ler extraordinaire\, Edwin Huizinga and guitarist William Coulter play the
 ir jaw-dropping distillations of Vivaldi’s four seasons. This evening wi
 ll bring us the joy of Spring and the visceral excitement of Summer as we 
 hear these two instruments cover an entire orchestra’s worth of texture
 \, melody and soul. In the second half of the concert we bring back Canada
 ’s award-winning quartet\, The Fretless\, this time joining forces with 
 the stunning vocals of Madeleine Rogers. This pan-Canadian group is reinve
 nting the meaning of string quartet and bringing the sounds of their respe
 ctive string cultures into indie territory\, garnering new audiences\, new
  sounds and creating a whole new horizon. Pulling it all together\, Rockpo
 rt’s Artistic Director Maeve Gilchrist will bring her harp\, poetry and 
 context to each act to turn this whole evening into an unforgettable story
  of songs\, tunes and concerti!\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: h
 ttps://northofboston.org/event/strings-on-strings/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/strings-on-strings/
END:VEVENT
