SUMMARY:Words & Music: The Celtic Spirit
DTSTART:20260913T120000
DTEND:20260913T133000
DTSTAMP:20260827T212256Z
UID:92de2b03a641f8915b6ae92070b385@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join host Maeve Gilchrist and musical guests\, Lindsay O Donov
 an\, David Coffin\, Seamus Egan\, Edwin Huizinga\, Nuala Kennedy and some 
 special guests in this intimate hour-long celebration of the time-old rela
 tionship between words and music. Location: Third Floor Reception Hall Dur
 ing this meditative performance we ask our artists to share words of meani
 ng: poetry and prose\, personal stories and tales of the imagination. Set 
 against a soundscape of songs\, improvisation and melodies designed to mov
 e the spirit.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofbost
 on.org/event/words-music-the-celtic-spirit/
