DTEND:20260919T234500
DTSTAMP:20260827T212256Z
UID:f70a53a0107404cd284eb6012ec5f6@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Bring the whole family to listen to a storyteller share tales 
 about nature\, form and creativity\, followed by a hands‑on segment wher
 e everyone is invited to create together. This all-ages workshop is design
 ed to highlight ideas of storytelling through paper\, visual narrative\, h
 andmade objects — concepts central to Noguchi’s work. Be sure to check
  out Isamu Noguchi: “I am not a designer” after the session!\n\nSource
