BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Reckoners with Kevin James Graham
DTSTART:20261016T200000
DTEND:20261016T220000
DTSTAMP:20260827T212256Z
UID:fa3403051694f9b1359572a99b8a19@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Rooted in soul and steeped in rock ‘n’ roll\, Reckoners is
  a Boston-based band built from some of the region’s most respected and 
 road-tested musicians. Fronted by singer and guitarist Tim Gearan\, the gr
 oup features guitarist and band leader Johnny Trama (Bettye LaVette\, The 
 Silks\, Dub Apocalypse)\, drummer Tom Arey (Peter Wolf\, The J. Geils Band
 \, G. Love\, Vapors of Morphine) bassist Marc Hickox (Bettye LaVette\, Cha
 rlie Musselwhite)\, and keyboardist Darby Wolf (Bettye LaVette\, Rubblebuc
 ket). Together\, they channel the grit and groove of classic soul and rock
  into something timeless and deeply personal. Their self-produced debut al
 bum — now streaming on all major platforms — has drawn more than 43\,0
 00 monthly listeners and features the standout single “Looking for a Rea
 son” with guest vocals by Susan Tedeschi. Reckoners have been building m
 omentum across New England with sold-out headline shows and support slots 
 alongside artists including Tedeschi Trucks Band\, The Wallflowers\, and B
 onnie Raitt. Their music and live performances were recently spotlighted i
 n Relix Magazine.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northof
 boston.org/event/reckoners-with-kevin-james-graham/
LOCATION:The Cut\, 177 Main Street\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01930
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/reckoners-with-kevin-james-graham/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vitamin String Quartet and Girl Named Tom
DTSTART:20261016T193000
DTEND:20261016T213000
DTSTAMP:20260827T212256Z
UID:1e6cf6f8eeb84939156a53403f8fa3@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Mahaiwe Performing Arts Center has added a co-headline per
 formance from musical acts Vitamin String Quartet and Girl Named Tom to it
 s schedule. The performance is part of the groups’ Crazy Ordinary World 
 tour. Known for transforming pop and rock anthems into virtuosic instrumen
 tals\, and fresh off Season 4 in Netflix’s hit series Bridgerton \, Vita
 min String Quartet teams up with Girl Named Tom\, whose breathtaking harmo
 nies and heartfelt songwriting won The Voice in 2021 and have solidified t
 heir status as one of the leading lights in new American folk music.\n\nSo
 urces: The Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/vitam
 in-string-quartet-and-girl-named-tom/
LOCATION:Indigo Room at Mahaiwe Performing Arts Center\, 20 Castle Street
 \, Great Barrington\, 01230
URL:https://berkshires.org/events-old/vitamin-string-quartet-and-girl-name
 d-tom/
END:VEVENT
